{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "context": "observed", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "7289492355873722368", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "linkedin-posts-2025-01-27-if-tomorrow-money-disappeared-what-md-a7e869457a:c001:e002:973514e4", "kind": "fact_claim", "locator": "lines 9-25", "metadata_hash": "62e6eee5cbf495f5fb9930e787c4e9bb552440dba542ccdd33df7c39d09da347", "published_at": "2025-01-27T04:00:09.859000Z", "quote": "money serves only three simple functions: 1. A universal equivalent – simplifying trade. 2. A means of exchange – accelerating the movement of goods in the economy. 3. A store of value – allowing wealth to accumulate.", "source_hash": "c81791cacf4c35a273a90d6631c6016ada128a7f26192a3461d0159f4ead1fbc", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2025-01-27-if-tomorrow-money-disappeared-what-md-a7e869457a", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-realestatetraining-successskills-activity-7289492355873722368-c7-s", "speaker_id": "", "statement": "Money serves three functions according to Karl Marx: universal equivalent, means of exchange, and store of value.", "time": "", "title": "If Tomorrow Money Disappeared, What Would You Have Left?", "topic": "sales strategy", "topic_slug": "sales-strategy", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2025-01-27-if-tomorrow-money-disappeared-what-md-a7e869457a:u000001"}
